---
// Documents.astro - Credentials and verification
---

<div class="tab-panel" id="panel-documents">
  <h2>Documents – Verification</h2>

  <p class="tldr"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Resume • RN license verification • Key credentials</p>

  <div class="document-grid">
    <div class="document-card">
      <h3>Resume</h3>
      <p class="institution">Current resume (PDF).</p>
      <div class="document-links">
        <a href="/assets/resume.pdf" download>Download Resume</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="document-card">
      <h3>Registered Nurse – Compact Multistate License</h3>
      <p class="license-info">FL RN9613731, Unencumbered, Expires 07/31/2026</p>
      <p>License status can be verified via the Nursys QuickConfirm portal.</p>
      <div class="document-links">
        <a href="https://www.nursys.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Verify Online</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="document-card">
      <h3>Associate Degree in Nursing (ADN)</h3>
      <p class="institution">ADN — Nursing, 2012 · Chamberlain College of Nursing</p>
      <div class="document-links">
        <a href="/assets/pp_NURSING_ADN.pdf" download>Download Credential (PDF)</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="document-card">
      <h3>Programming for Everybody (Python)</h3>
      <p class="institution">University of Michigan | Coursera</p>
      <div class="document-links">
        <a href="https://www.coursera.org/account/accomplishments/verify/YNCNEVGXEJDG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Verify Online</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="document-card">
      <h3>Systems Thinking Basics</h3>
      <p class="institution">Coursera</p>
      <div class="document-links">
        <a href="https://coursera.org/verify/IL7X19XU9VH9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Verify Online</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .tldr {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    padding: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-teal);
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .document-grid {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .document-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .document-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-teal);
  }

  .document-card h3 {
    color: var(--color-teal);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .institution {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .license-info {
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .document-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .document-links a {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .document-links a:hover {
    background: var(--color-teal);
    color: white;
    border-color: var(--color-teal);
  }
</style>
